## AI Assistance Guidelines
When working with AI:
- Provide clear context about the current task
- Reference existing code patterns and conventions
- Ask for explanations of complex implementations
- Request code reviews and suggestions for improvements
- Ensure generated code follows project standards
- Mention if changes need to be deployed after completion
- Ask for deployment verification steps if needed 